<name>
HTTP does not reuse a connection with a different HAProxy client IP
</name>
<command>
http://%HOSTIP:%HTTPPORT/%TESTNUMBER --haproxy-clientip 1.2.3.4 -w '%{num_connects}\n' --next http://%HOSTIP:%HTTPPORT/%TESTNUMBER0001 --haproxy-clientip 5.6.7.8 -w '%{num_connects}\n'
